        "text": "Bound to this test by name, and `1 passed` is in the pattern deliberately: a filter matching nothing prints `0 passed` and would otherwise read as success. The test settles the equalities by `Kernel::def_eq` with no lemma -- Nat.gcd, Nat.div and Int.rec all compute -- and includes the inequality `1/6 != 1/2` so that a def_eq comparing everything equal could not make the positive checks vacuous.",
